  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile settings with scvi_n200 encoder (config_005) achieve high accuracy (0.6501), suggesting profile setting and encoder choice are critical. This experiment tests whether changing aggregation from avgpool to transformer (while keeping scvi_n200 and multiprofile) isolates the effect of aggregation method. It directly compares two aggregation strategies under a validated encoder/profile combination, clarifying whether transformer aggregation further improves performance. This balances exploitation of the scvi_n200/multiprofile trend with exploration of key design choices."
